Subject: [PATCH] Split professional page into About and Booking pages

- /professional/$id is now a redesigned About page (hero, quick facts,
  expertise, session formats, availability, sticky Book CTA)
- /professional/$id/book is a dedicated booking page (form, PayHere flow)
- /professional/$id is a layout that loads the profile once and shares it
- Shared profile types/loader moved to lib/professional-profile.ts
- PayHere return/cancel URLs now point to /book; old links with ?payment=
  on the About page redirect to /book
